    "body": "@toji Any special considerations for WebVR integration.  I was thinking the WebVR  rAF API should take over for that use case.  Perhaps the regular OffscreenCanvas commit() and rAF() should throw exceptions when the OffscreenCanvas is hooked up to a VR layer.  WDYT?\n",
